## Security Notes

Private keys, passwords and sensitive information must never be committed to Git.

The repository ignores common sensitive file patterns through `.gitignore`.

Secrets introduced later in the project will be managed using Ansible Vault.

## Purpose

This project is intended as a practical Ansible learning and portfolio project focused on realistic DevOps infrastructure automation rather than isolated command examples.

The final repository will demonstrate how Ansible can be used to consistently configure, secure and manage multiple Linux servers from a centralized Control Node.
